<% layout("/layouts/boilerplates") %>

<style>
  .privacy-container{
    max-width:900px;
    margin:auto;
    background:#fff;
    padding:35px;
    border-radius:18px;
    box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
  }

  .privacy-title{
    font-weight:700;
    font-size:32px;
  }

  .privacy-sub{
    color:#717171;
    font-size:15px;
  }

  .privacy-section{
    margin-top:28px;
  }

  .privacy-section h5{
    font-weight:600;
    margin-bottom:8px;
  }

  .privacy-section p{
    color:#555;
    line-height:1.7;
  }

  .airbnb-highlight{
    color:#ff385c;
    font-weight:600;
  }
</style>


<div class="container mt-5 mb-5">
  <div class="privacy-container">

    <h2 class="privacy-title">Privacy Policy</h2>
    <p class="privacy-sub">
      Last updated: 2026
    </p>
    <hr>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <h5>1. Introduction</h5>
      <p>
        Welcome to our <span class="airbnb-highlight">Airbnb Clone</span>. 
        This platform is created for educational and portfolio purposes. 
        We are committed to protecting your privacy and ensuring that your personal data 
        remains safe and secure.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <h5>2. Information We Collect</h5>
      <p>
        When you sign up or use this website, we may collect basic information such as:
        username, email address, and booking details. This information is used only to 
        provide core functionality like authentication, booking, and reviews.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <h5>3. How We Use Your Information</h5>
      <p>
        Your data is used only for improving user experience and enabling features such as 
        login, booking properties, and managing listings. We do not sell or share your 
        personal information with third-party services.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <h5>4. Data Security</h5>
      <p>
        We implement secure authentication practices. Passwords are encrypted and stored 
        safely using modern hashing techniques. However, this project is a demo and not 
        intended for real-world financial transactions.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <h5>5. Cookies & Sessions</h5>
      <p>
        We may use cookies and session storage to keep users logged in and improve 
        website functionality. These cookies do not store sensitive personal information.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <h5>6. Educational Purpose</h5>
      <p>
        This website is built strictly for learning and portfolio demonstration. 
        No real payments or commercial bookings are processed.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
      <h5>7. Contact</h5>
      <p>
        If you have any questions regarding this privacy policy, feel free to contact 
        the developer through the project repository or portfolio.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
